  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The vision of WaterColors Southern origins, the respect for the existing natural features and the intimate small-town planning is what you will see while vacationing in WaterColor.<br><br>The two-story house is tastefully and comfortably decorated and gives you the sense of being 'at home' the moment you walk through the front door. The two king-bed master suites upstairs each open onto their own large balcony for complete privacy. A third bedroom with a queen bed on the first gives enough sleeping space for the kids or a third couple. Each bedroom has a private bath. While sitting on the front porch you can enjoy a cup of coffee or a glass of wine while overlooking a park. <br>A short walk to the neighborhood pool or a 15 minute walk to the beach and enough activities for all ages keeps everyone happy. Walk to the town center for dining and entertainment or drive to any one of many world-class restaurants located on Scenic 30-A.<br>We provide passes to all pools and Camp Watercolor and the 5-star private beach club. We also provide 4 adult-size bikes and if you have a need for child-size bikes, we work with a company that can provide the appropriate bikes and/or equipment. <br>There is a 6 passenger electric cart available at an additional daily rate. <br>The house is well supplied for your stay with beach towels, chairs, toys, and just about anything to call our home YOUR home!<br><br>PLEASE CALL FOR AVAILABILITY AND LOCATION<br><br>Everyone deserves a special getaway, let Watercolor be yours!<br><br>Keywords: House",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "RELAX, RENEW, REJUVENATE!"
        }
      ],
